#: ../../source/declarative/mvu.rst:2
msgid "1. The Elm MVU Loop & App Anatomy"
msgstr "1. Elm MVU 循环与应用结构"

#: ../../source/declarative/mvu.rst:4
msgid ""
"Every declarative Xent program follows the **Model–View–Update (MVU)** "
"architecture introduced by Elm. Understanding how data, messages, and "
"arena memory flow through one frame makes every control in "
"``<xtk/xtk.h>`` predictable."
msgstr ""
"每一个 Xent 声明式程序都遵循源于 Elm 的 **Model–View–Update（MVU）** 架构。"
"理清一帧之内数据、消息与帧内存池的流向，就能以一致的方式驾驭 ``<xtk/xtk.h>`` 中的所有控件。"

#: ../../source/declarative/mvu.rst:10
msgid "The Unidirectional Frame Loop"
msgstr "单向帧循环"

#: ../../source/declarative/mvu.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Model**: A plain C ``struct`` that stores your entire application state"
" in one place—current page index, form text, selection indices, dialog "
"flags, and loaded data."
msgstr ""
"**Model（状态模型）** ：一个普通的 C ``struct`` ，集中保存应用的全部状态——当前页面索引、"
"表单文本、选中项下标、对话框开关标志以及已加载的业务数据。"

#: ../../source/declarative/mvu.rst:29
msgid ""
"**View** (``XtkEl *view(XtkUi *ui, void *model)``): A pure description "
"function that reads ``Model`` and returns a lightweight tree of ``XtkEl "
"*`` descriptors allocated in ``ui``'s per-frame arena. Interactive "
"controls carry ``XtkMsg`` values describing *what happened* when "
"triggered."
msgstr ""
"**View（视图函数** ``XtkEl *view(XtkUi *ui, void *model)`` **）** ：读取 ``Model`` 并返回在 "
"``ui`` 帧内存池中分配的轻量 ``XtkEl *`` 描述树。交互控件携带 ``XtkMsg`` 消息值，用于表达触发时发生了什么动作。"

#: ../../source/declarative/mvu.rst:33
msgid ""
"**Update** (``void update(void *model, XtkMsg msg)``): When the user "
"clicks a button, edits text, or scrolls a list, the host enqueues the "
"control's ``XtkMsg``. Before the next frame builds, the runtime drains "
"all queued messages through ``update()``, which inspects ``msg.tag`` and "
"mutates ``Model`` in place."
msgstr ""
"**Update（更新函数** ``void update(void *model, XtkMsg msg)`` **）** ：当用户点击按钮、编辑文本或滚动列表时，"
"宿主会将该控件绑定的 ``XtkMsg`` 放入队列。在构建下一帧前，运行时依次将队列中的消息交给 ``update()`` 处理，"
"根据 ``msg.tag`` 就地修改 ``Model`` 。"

#: ../../source/declarative/mvu.rst:38
msgid ""
"**Reconcile & Commit**: Once the message queue drains, ``flux_run`` "
"resets the ``XtkUi`` scratch arena, calls ``view()`` once, diffs the new "
"element tree against the previous composition, and commits the minimal "
"``XtkBatch`` mutations to the live Windows controls."
msgstr ""
"**协调与提交（Reconcile & Commit）** ：消息队列清空后， ``flux_run`` 重置 ``XtkUi`` 帧内存池，"
"调用一次 ``view()`` ，将新生成的元素树与上一帧结构比对，并向现有的 Windows 原生控件原子提交最小 ``XtkBatch`` 变更。"

