msgid "Designing ``Model`` and ``XtkMsg``"
msgstr "设计 ``Model`` 与 ``XtkMsg``"

#: ../../source/declarative/mvu.rst:115
msgid "Numbering Message Tags and Carrying Parameters"
msgstr "消息标签编号与附加参数"

#: ../../source/declarative/mvu.rst:117
msgid "``XtkMsg`` is a plain value struct defined in ``<xtk/xtk_msg.h>``:"
msgstr "``XtkMsg`` 是定义在 ``<xtk/xtk_msg.h>`` 中的普通值结构体："

#: ../../source/declarative/mvu.rst:130
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Start your enum at** ``1``: Zero-initialized descriptor fields (such as"
" an omitted ``.click`` in ``(XtkButtonDesc) {.style = "
"XTK_BUTTON_SUBTLE}``) have ``tag == 0``, which tells the runtime to leave"
" that event unbound."
msgstr ""
"**枚举从** ``1`` **开始编号** ：零初始化的描述结构体字段（例如 ``(XtkButtonDesc) {.style = XTK_BUTTON_SUBTLE}`` "
"中未指定的 ``.click`` ）默认 ``tag == 0`` ，表示该事件保持未绑定状态。"

#: ../../source/declarative/mvu.rst:133
msgid ""
"**Attach item indices with** ``xtk_msg_i``: When several buttons share "
"one action (such as toolbar commands or dynamically generated rows), bind"
" ``xtk_msg_i(MSG_REMOVE_ITEM, row_index)`` so ``update()`` receives both "
"``msg.tag`` and ``msg.i``."
msgstr ""
"**用** ``xtk_msg_i`` **附带条目下标** ：当多个按钮共用同一类动作（如工具栏命令或动态生成的行按钮）时，"
"绑定 ``xtk_msg_i(MSG_REMOVE_ITEM, row_index)`` 即可让 ``update()`` 同时收到 ``msg.tag`` 与 ``msg.i`` 。"

#: ../../source/declarative/mvu.rst:139
msgid "Scaling ``update()`` with a Dispatch Table"
msgstr "用函数分发表扩展大型 ``update()``"

#: ../../source/declarative/mvu.rst:141
msgid ""
"Once an application grows past a dozen messages, split handlers into "
"focused functions indexed by a dispatch array (the pattern used by "
"Fluxent's Gallery and Installer Wizard):"
msgstr ""
