#: ../../source/declarative/mvu.rst:167
msgid "Computing Derived Values in ``view()``"
msgstr "在 ``view()`` 中即时计算派生显示值"

#: ../../source/declarative/mvu.rst:169
msgid ""
"Keep ``Model`` normalized—store raw state (such as ``file_done`` and "
"``file_count``) and compute formatted labels, percentages, and "
"enabled/disabled flags on the fly inside ``view()``. Because ``view()`` "
"runs every time ``Model`` changes, derived UI properties stay consistent "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"保持 ``Model`` 字段精简规范——只存储原始业务状态（如 ``file_done`` 与 ``file_count`` ），"
"而在 ``view()`` 中即时计算格式化文本、进度百分比和按钮禁用条件。由于每次 ``Model`` 变化后都会运行 ``view()`` ，"
"所有派生界面属性都会自动保持同步。"

#: ../../source/declarative/mvu.rst:175
msgid "Registering Control Modules"
msgstr "注册控件模块"

#: ../../source/declarative/mvu.rst:177
msgid ""
"In **Fluxent 0.3.3**, controls link on demand through "
"``<fluxent/flux_controls.h>``:"
msgstr "在 **Fluxent 0.3.3** 中，各控件通过 ``<fluxent/flux_controls.h>`` 按需链接："

#: ../../source/declarative/mvu.rst:179
msgid ""
"**Production builds**: Call ``flux_controls_use(&flux_ctrl_<name>)`` for "
"each control module your views instantiate (for example "
"``&flux_ctrl_container`` for ``xtk_column`` / ``xtk_row``, "
"``&flux_ctrl_text``, ``&flux_ctrl_button``). Unreferenced controls are "
"stripped by the linker."
msgstr ""
"**正式发布构建** ：对视图用到的每类控件调用 ``flux_controls_use(&flux_ctrl_<name>)`` "
"（例如 ``xtk_column`` / ``xtk_row`` 对应 ``&flux_ctrl_container`` ，以及 ``&flux_ctrl_text`` 、 "
"``&flux_ctrl_button`` ），未引用的控件实现会被链接器自动裁剪。"

#: ../../source/declarative/mvu.rst:183
msgid ""
"**Prototyping**: Call ``flux_controls_all()`` once at startup to register"
" the entire 70+ control catalog while iterating on UI layout."
msgstr "**快速原型阶段** ：启动时调用一次 ``flux_controls_all()`` 即可注册全部 70 余种内置控件，方便随时调整界面。"

#: ../../source/declarative/mvu.rst:186
msgid "Register modules before calling ``flux_run``."
msgstr "请在调用 ``flux_run`` 之前完成控件模块注册。"

#: ../../source/declarative/mvu.rst:189
msgid "Scratch Arena Memory Lifetimes"
msgstr "帧内存池（Scratch Arena）生命周期"

#: ../../source/declarative/mvu.rst:191
msgid ""
"``XtkUi *`` owns a fast bump-pointer scratch arena that resets at the "
"beginning of every ``view()`` pass and stays alive until the frame's "
"``XtkBatch`` commits:"
msgstr ""
"``XtkUi *`` 内置高速线性帧内存池，在每次 ``view()`` 开始时重置，并持续有效至当帧 ``XtkBatch`` 提交完成："

#: ../../source/declarative/mvu.rst:194
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Dynamic text**: Allocate formatted strings with ``xtk_fmt(ui, \"Count: "
"%d\", m->n)`` or copy transient buffers with ``xtk_strdup(ui, temp)``. "
"String literals (``\"Reset\"``) and heap/static strings stored inside "
"``Model`` outlive the frame and can be passed directly."
msgstr ""
"**动态文本** ：通过 ``xtk_fmt(ui, \"Count: %d\", m->n)`` 格式化字符串，或用 ``xtk_strdup(ui, temp)`` "
"拷贝临时缓冲区。字符串字面量（ ``\"Reset\"`` ）以及 ``Model`` 内部持有的持久字符串生命周期跨帧，可直接传入。"

#: ../../source/declarative/mvu.rst:198
msgid ""
"**Dynamic child arrays**: When building a variable number of children "
"from a loop, allocate the child pointer array from the same arena and "
"terminate it with ``XTK_END``:"
msgstr "**动态子元素数组** ：在循环中生成可变数量的子元素时，从同一个帧内存池分配指针数组并以 ``XTK_END`` 结尾："
